<title>CROATIA: Croatian Aug real wage index up to 110.4 vs 108.8.</title>
<headline>Croatian Aug real wage index up to 110.4 vs 108.8.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		  AUGUST     JULY     AUG '95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)    110.4     108.8	103.3</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,085     2,071	1,839</p>
<p> -Goods and services sector     2,064     2,058	1,797</p>
<p> -Public sector		     2,141     2,108	1,962</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
